        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hit title first released on e-reader app Lovestruck: Choose Your Romance and now optimized for Steam.<br>Meet, romance, and go on thrilling adventures alongside these modern-day Gangsters over the course of several seasons!<br>Plus, watch the trailer and collect illustrations of the most dramatic scenes.<br>Skip ahead, save your progress, rewind &amp; replay your favorite parts! Multiple endings to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're leading an ordinary life in sunny California when suddenly you get kidnapped by LA's most wanted gang! Thrown into the extravagant life of these stylish but dangerous gangsters, you must choose one of them to watch over you.... but who can you trust? Living in the gang's world isn't easy, yet in the face of all the shootouts and explosions, an undeniable attraction begins to form... Not only are you the key to important information the gang needs, but you are also in possession of something else they're missing in their lives: your heart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chance Valentine &quot;The Boss&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yoshimitsu Valentine  &quot;The Yakuza&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aurora James 　&quot;The Hustler&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ash Winters  &quot;The Hitman&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Irving Monroe &quot;The Justice&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contents:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Stories from the app &quot;Lovestruck: Choose Your Romance&quot; up until Season 4</p>",
